XZ Utils liblzma
================

Source: https://github.com/tukaani-project/xz
Commit: 4b73f2ec19a99ef465282fbce633e8deb33691b3 (XZ Utils 5.8.3)
License: 0BSD

debz uses only liblzma's in-process streaming decoder for xz metadata. The
source-built static library enables the single-threaded decoder, all standard
XZ filters, and CRC32, CRC64, and SHA-256 checks. Encoders, the multithreaded
decoder, command-line tools, and repository/network functionality are not
built or invoked.

